    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e0b25ba630f4340268dbe5ca",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "无论最后谁输谁赢，\n应该都会是一场精彩的对决吧。\n对此深信不疑的我，追着她们前往操场。",
      "source_fingerprint": "afebbb6bc25827b61a329ef2c4db4c1aace55d442a26aa5f2f275bbbf374e09d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
